│     ├─6  text ", and those for various configuration sources like\n"
│     ├─7  inlineCode "pyproject.toml"
│     ├─8  text " files and the CLI, the various selectors also have precedence relationships with\neach other. In general, you can think of this precedence as increasing from the broadest selector\n("
│     ├─9  inlineCode "ALL"
│     ├─10 text ") to the narrowest single-rule selectors (e.g. "
│     ├─11 inlineCode "F401"
│     ├─12 text " or "
│     ├─13 inlineCode "unused-import"
│     └─14 text "):"
