├─63  paragraph[1]
│     └─0 text "Ruff labels fixes as \"safe\" and \"unsafe\". The meaning and intent of your code will be retained when\napplying safe fixes, but the meaning could change when applying unsafe fixes."
├─64  paragraph[1]
│     └─0 text "Specifically, an unsafe fix could lead to a change in runtime behavior, the removal of comments, or both,\nwhile safe fixes are intended to preserve runtime behavior and will only remove comments when deleting\nentire statements or expressions (e.g., removing unused imports)."
├─65  paragraph[9]
