├─112 paragraph[1]
│     └─0 text "To cover an entire \"logical\" line (a multi-line statement or suite header),\nan \"ignore\" comment may be placed above the first line:"
├─113 code "# ruff: ignore[ARG001]  # Covers the entire function signature\ndef foo(\n    arg1,\n    arg2,\n):\n    pass\n\n# ruff: ignore[E501]  # Covers the entire list literal\nthings = [\n    \"really long string literal ...\",\n    \"really long string literal ...\",\n]"
│       lang: "python"
│       meta: null
├─114 paragraph[1]
