│     ├─4 text " rule can be disabled,\nor an inline "
│     ├─5 inlineCode "noqa"
│     └─6 text " suppression can be added to the end of the \"disable\" comment."
├─128 paragraph[1]
│     └─0 text "Range suppressions cannot be used to enable or select rules that aren't already\nselected by the project configuration or runtime flags. An \"enable\" comment can only\nbe used to terminate a preceding \"disable\" comment with identical codes."
